cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use this software, please cite it as below.'
title: 'tify-plugins — example plugins for the TIFY IIIF viewer'
abstract: >-
  Plugins for TIFY (tify@0.36.2), the slim IIIF document viewer, published
  as individual npm modules under @projektemacher/tify-plugin-*: a custom
  metadata side panel, OpenSeadragon overlays synced to pages (TEI word
  boxes or demo markers), HDR canvas status, per-tile C2PA provenance,
  display-only Annotorious annotations, and rendered MusicXML scores with
  playback. All panels dock into the TIFY viewer chrome.
